    "detailed_description": "Tactic Legends is a revolutionary card game that combines strategy, skill, and a touch of luck. Our game introduces a unique collection of cards and innovative mechanics that will captivate both new and experienced players.<br><br>Tactic Legends is an exhilarating online turn-based card game where strategy and skill are your greatest allies. Engage in intense battles against players worldwide, and prove your mettle by unlocking and collecting powerful cards from all collections to complete your ultimate decks.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collections</h2><br><strong>\ud83d\udd25 Fire Kingdom</strong><br>Fire Kingdom contains amazing flaming cards which will burn their enemies <br>Fire Kingdom have all type of cards but specially have Bond Ability Cards<br><br><strong>\u2744\ufe0f Frost Kingdom</strong><br>Frost Kingdom have all the strong and Intense fighter who used to fight in most difficult conditions<br>Frost Kingdom specially have Spy Ability cards<br><br><strong>\ud83c\udf33 Jungle Kingdom</strong><br>Jungle Kingdom have most stealth and bloody jungle fighters<br>Jungle Kingdom specially have ReviveAbility cards<br><br><strong>\ud83d\ude08 Elves Kingdom</strong><br>Elves Kingdom have the most magical and scary fighters <br>Elves Kingdom specially have Muster Ability cards<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Card Properties</h2>Each card in Tactic Legends is assigned points that contribute to your overall strength in battle. Some cards come with unique abilities, adding an extra layer of strategy and excitement. Use these abilities wisely to gain the upper hand and outsmart your opponents.<br><br>some of some abilities are like these : <br><br><strong>Bond Ability</strong><br>Bond ability will be activated at least with 2 of same card ,Bond ability multiply each bond card points with total card amount<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/c15c6e0b4748dfe6f3eef96c5fbfbc30.poster.avif?t=1723837276\" width=614 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/c15c6e0b4748dfe6f3eef96c5fbfbc30.webm?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/c15c6e0b4748dfe6f3eef96c5fbfbc30.mp4?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Muster Ability</strong><br>Cards with muster ability will get all cards of the same clan in your hand and in your deck<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/ba1db1534a072b76b16fc411dc84d87d.poster.avif?t=1723837276\" width=614 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/ba1db1534a072b76b16fc411dc84d87d.webm?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/ba1db1534a072b76b16fc411dc84d87d.mp4?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Morale Ability</strong><br>ards with morale ability will add one point to all cards in the same row<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ce2b105111259e2b115aeb1499e4062.poster.avif?t=1723837276\" width=614 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ce2b105111259e2b115aeb1499e4062.webm?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ce2b105111259e2b115aeb1499e4062.mp4?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Horn Ability</strong><br>Horn Card will dublicate the points of the cards in the row that used in<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ad2320beebeaa09155637b6a1e20337.poster.avif?t=1723837276\" width=614 height=174 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ad2320beebeaa09155637b6a1e20337.webm?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3115650/extras/4ad2320beebeaa09155637b6a1e20337.mp4?t=1723837276\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>So what you are waiting for, Download the game and start fight \u2694\ufe0f",
